top-sort [k desc] limit 2
└─ union-all (rows≈2 cost≈256)
   ├─ project (k) (rows≈1 cost≈168)
   │  └─ filter (<= |t.y| 20) (rows≈1 cost≈160)
   │     └─ source t AS t row-groups (<= |t.y| 20) (rows≈5 cost≈80)
   └─ project (k) (rows≈1 cost≈88)
      └─ filter (== |t_1.y| 30) (rows≈1 cost≈80)
         └─ source t AS t_1 row-groups (== |t_1.y| 30) (rows≈5 cost≈40)
